# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# step 2.411: items given to people and things in Keeping Busy: the same reactions as using them
# (dialogue/unusables.dialogue keeps an identical copy for the use verb). each
# "<object id>_item_<item id>" title below jumps to one of these knots.

~ item_julian_snack
Julian: Thanks, but why are you giving me this?
Player: (Shoot.)
=> END

~ item_julian_cash
Julian: Hah! Nice joke.
He refuses to take your offering.
=> END

~ item_julian_camera
Player: (I don't think he needs to see this...)
=> END

~ item_julian_phone
Player: (I doubt that dickhead will help us with this dead phone.)
=> END

~ item_julian_charger
Player: (I've no business showing my damn charger to this dickhead.)
=> END

~ item_handy_later
Player: (I think this might come in handy later...)
=> END

~ item_jayce_snack
Player: (Yeah, I'm not giving him that.)
Player: (Don't want him to get the wrong idea...)
=> END

~ item_jayce_cash
He just takes the money.
do Inventory.remove_amount("cash", Inventory.get_count("cash"))
Jayce: 'Preciate it, sugar.
=> END

~ item_jayce_camera
Player: (I think I should keep this to myself for now...)
=> END

~ item_jayce_phone
Player: (I don't need his help with this...)
=> END

~ item_jayce_pins
Player: (I think I'll pass on that...)
=> END

~ item_layla_camera
Player: (I should hold onto this for now...)
=> END

~ item_layla_cash
Layla: Oh, cash?
do Inventory.remove_amount("cash", Inventory.get_count("cash"))
Layla: Thanks, Fiona!
She blushes.
=> END

~ item_layla_phone
Player: (I should figure out a way to charge it before I hand it back to her...)
=> END

~ item_layla_old_charger
Layla: Oh, Fiona...
Layla: I don't think your phone's charger will work with mine.
Layla: It's... old.
Player: (She's right.)
=> END

~ item_no_electronic_lockpick
Player: (I can't... lockpick an electronic lock.)
=> END

~ item_keypad_dumb
Player: (This is dumb...)
=> END

~ item_wont_work
Player: (I don't think this will work out...)
=> END

~ item_cola_machine
Player: (Giving cola... to a machine?)
Player: (Hmmmm.)
=> END

~ item_portrait_snack
Player: Have a snack, dickhead.
# layla is with fiona everywhere except greene's office
if Flags.get_level_flag("layla_waiting_outside_office") == false:
	Layla: Fiona, are you alright?
	Player: Yes. Sorry about that.
	Player: (Shoot.)
=> END

~ item_no_returns
Layla: I don't think we can return snacks, Fiona.
Player: Hmm.
=> END

~ item_julian_spot
Player: (I don't think he wants me putting anything here.)
=> END

~ item_locker_julian_snoop
Player: (I can't snoop into Julian's locker with Layla around.)
Player: (That's a bit much.)
Player: (There might be some lockers in this building she won't mind me looking into, though...)
=> END

~ item_locker_layla_snoop
Player: (I can't snoop into Layla's locker with her around.)
Player: (That's a bit much.)
Player: (There might be some lockers in this building she won't mind me looking into, though...)
=> END

~ item_jayce_locker_camera
Player: (Nah. I need to keep this to myself for now.)
=> END

